{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1372518-help-with-a-lunar-animal-form","id":1372518,"title":"Help with a Lunar animal form","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-03T12:59:44-08:00","id":1372518,"title":"Help with a Lunar animal form","content":"As mentioned in my request where a certain martial art style ran off to, I'm working on a Lunar modeled after Saint Germi from Drifters. I envisioned his spirit animal as a peacock. But... not sure how to actually do the peacock form. Closest I could think of was a swan, but that doesn't work entirely. I was envisioning his hybrid form and fighting style kinda like Shen from Kung Fu Panda two with deadly claw kicks and feints using his feathers to distract, along with the Dreaming Pearl style. Kinda a side tangent there, but I need a bird that's not super hunter like the Eagle, but not bludgeoning and mate-happy like the Swan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3071-magusrogue","name":"MagusRogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3071_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T16:34:33-08:00","id":1372565,"title":"","content":"The only other birds there are stats for off the top of my head are Raiton (too small) and Owl (too nocturnal).<br /> <br /> If he's going to be fighting in hybrid form, the animal forms precise stats don't matter much - you could probably use some halfway decent mishmash of eagle and raiton and call it a day.<br /> <br /> Here is one such mishmash:<br /> Join battle 4, Fly 7, Stealth 3, Tracking 5, Senses 6, Looking Cool 8<br /> Resolve 3, Guile 1<br /> Attack: Talons 8 (8)<br /> Evasion 3, Parry 1<br /> Soak/Hardness 1/0<br /> Especially Imposing Features: Characters that see a peacock and have no tie to it suffer -1 resolve against instill rolls to add ties. Instill rolls to create or strengthen ties don't suffer a penalty for targeting multiple people.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23597-autxauty","name":"autXautY","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-04T05:53:02-08:00","id":1372688,"title":"","content":"Huh I like it. Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3071-magusrogue","name":"MagusRogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3071_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-13T23:38:27-07:00","id":1396321,"title":"","content":"wasnt there a heartstone in previous editions that made the bearer unable to be killed unless someone went on a quest?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25272-cypheriel","name":"Cypheriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-14T00:30:09-07:00","id":1396325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_containe